libfprint uses the Meson build system. See
https://mesonbuild.com/Quick-guide.html for details on how to compile
libfprint, and run "meson configure build" to list the available options.

A C compiler is sufficient for the default build. The optional SIGFM matcher
(-Dsigfm=enabled) additionally needs a C++17 compiler and OpenCV.

To install the Goodix 27c6:55a2 driver alongside your distribution's
libfprint and set up fingerprint login, follow INSTALL_55a2.md.
